        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - LLM Agents",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The model never explicitly outputs \"THOUGHT / ACTION / OBSERVATION\" labels.\nThose are conceptual. What actually happens:\n1. Model responds with `tool_use` content blocks — that's the action\n2. Your code calls the tool and returns `tool_result` content blocks\n3. Model continues — possibly more tool calls, eventually `end_turn`\n4. At `end_turn` with no tool calls, the final text response is the answer"
    },
